# RAGStrike Dashboard -- PLACEHOLDER (Phase 1)
#
# PURPOSE
#   Container image for the Streamlit dashboard.
#
# WHY IT IS A SEPARATE IMAGE
#   The dashboard is an HTTP client of the API and never imports the engine (ADR-010). Separate
#   images make that boundary physical rather than aspirational: this image does not need the
#   database, the plugin packs, or the adapters, and it must not have them.
#
# FUTURE RESPONSIBILITIES
#   - Install only the [dashboard] extra
#   - Non-root user
#   - RAGSTRIKE_DASHBOARD__API_BASE_URL as the sole configuration point
#   - Expose 8501
#
# NEVER
#   - Include the engine, the database, or attack packs
#   - Mount data/ or reports/

FROM python:3.11-slim AS runtime
# Phase 11: install ragstrike[dashboard], create a non-root user, CMD streamlit run

LABEL org.opencontainers.image.title="RAGStrike Dashboard" \
      org.opencontainers.image.licenses="Apache-2.0"
